            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceInk 2.25-ads.2</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Reduced work inside the global keyboard event handler.</li>
  <li>Avoided repeated shortcut-cancellation callbacks during ordinary typing while preserving cancellation between modifier taps.</li>
  <li>Stopped the AutoLearn focus observer from retrying a finished run loop.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
